cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Whispering Lore: A Comprehensive Digital Compendium of World Mythology and Folklore"
type: dataset
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
authors:
  - name: "Mats Olsson"
    website: "https://whisperinglore.com/about.html"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive dataset of 3,668 mythical creatures, 2,185 folklore
  stories, and 641 magical artifacts from 212 countries and territories,
  spanning 32 cultural regions. Each entry is researched, documented, and
  linked to its cultural tradition. Includes structured metadata,
  full-text story content, item descriptions, and bidirectional
  creature-story cross-references.
keywords:
  - mythology
  - folklore
  - mythical creatures
  - legends
  - oral tradition
  - world mythology
  - digital humanities
  - folktales
  - comparative mythology
  - cultural heritage
  - magical artifacts
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21941501"
url: "https://whisperinglore.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/maf-ran/whispering-lore"
version: "1.3.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
contact:
